{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "version": "ef596b8c2fd101f580a10f940c33388e86bac56c8ba366caf322d58a77093f9f",
  "duration": 153.91199999999995,
  "synthetic": true,
  "voiceSha256": "73d28cd4b1bcecaf304c58583255add5cd82ea49e6ec778cf915a9c9cd83ffee",
  "captionsSha256": "f6ccd5cca39965cfb4f4916650f4e0bcf1097cb822de4e2b1f4f15370dcedbbe",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s00",
      "text": "机器能算出飞船轨道，却曾被一个潦草的数字难住。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 0.45,
      "end": 4.602,
      "duration": 4.152,
      "key": "7f3cd8e43df11b09e1427f114881fcb60916a9ca79e1343d2c2ea73044740b98"
    },
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "算得快，为什么不等于看得懂？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 4.7620000000000005,
      "end": 7.210000000000001,
      "duration": 2.448,
      "key": "c6429a4951e9a6aac18566b391595a539ac4d970be7f4a78afdca1c477725810"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "人工智能的七十年，就在跨越这道鸿沟。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 7.370000000000001,
      "end": 10.682,
      "duration": 3.312,
      "key": "fe7c9c180551be0686062c920a08fcce2bfaff9ddc871541b6977621ce3734ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "一九五六年，达特茅斯让人工智能成为一个研究领域。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 10.982000000000001,
      "end": 15.23,
      "duration": 4.248,
      "key": "9b4ba0034f322894ed57467feff85c44b1ecc23fbfd935f80b7bc33dd6f9964f"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "人们最初的一条思路，是把知识翻译成规则。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 15.39,
      "end": 18.966,
      "duration": 3.576,
      "key": "59752e06be1dd6bd488eec76f7a91242d862eb77e39288fbe2a043e002a9554e"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "一条横线，接一条斜线，像七。程序照着条件判断。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 19.126,
      "end": 24.022000000000002,
      "duration": 4.896,
      "key": "024f4f573f07d6c43be7b7d9cf97f7ffa93392b43a7627053f1fa883a43e7b0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "可笔迹一变，例外就来。现实的复杂，远超规则的清单。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 24.182000000000002,
      "end": 28.910000000000004,
      "duration": 4.728,
      "key": "bf41707f90552f4d2131d387886a0ed21af2d856fb97f3872ac8c932f0552e82"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "另一些研究者选择反过来：不写死规则，让机器从样本里学。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 29.110000000000003,
      "end": 33.814,
      "duration": 4.704,
      "key": "db6fb8b1f4e9654e074232886ba8f7c54255b18a583352db7c968556b949e82d"
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "同一个数字，写上千百遍。每次猜错，就用误差修正参数。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 33.974,
      "end": 38.965999999999994,
      "duration": 4.992,
      "key": "a357275f82a7b8129495cd3e541626ff92cf2e169ab496c7a4e41353451cdab7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "反向传播高效算出各层的调整方向。网络开始有办法，一层层学。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 39.12599999999999,
      "end": 44.76599999999999,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "key": "2cd2ef8819c9130349f70ee6e68f34a5b5340fecc0715f26c097b54004669ad4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "一九八六年的研究推动了这条路线，但真正起飞，还要等两个条件。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 44.92599999999999,
      "end": 49.89399999999999,
      "duration": 4.968,
      "key": "2a4096c951c7a7cee754b7066f7aff66860671276c818208c5696b06c5206bb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "更多的数据，以及更强的计算。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 50.05399999999999,
      "end": 52.621999999999986,
      "duration": 2.568,
      "key": "8f776c69920d2c83f00190c1b9ae28e5398f8a39051e21097855bd26b8c65890"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "二零一二年，阿列克斯网络在图像识别竞赛中取得突破。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 52.97199999999999,
      "end": 57.435999999999986,
      "duration": 4.464,
      "key": "22d1a18eaf57087f27faa4c4bf6537d745d61514a5bcef3ad0b0db03aba6361d"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "它把简单特征逐层组合。边缘连成局部，局部汇成模式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 57.59599999999998,
      "end": 62.58799999999998,
      "duration": 4.992,
      "key": "6a7b78c5ceb432e7095c7bc234c9356980228374d980849f09d25c296348272d"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "海量标注图片提供例子，图形处理器让成批计算同时推进。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 62.747999999999976,
      "end": 67.47599999999997,
      "duration": 4.728,
      "key": "7b163b6b6f707adf3686998bd0e88e6984345dcc7d0fb0e15a11729830e5c6c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "算法、数据、算力，在这里形成了强大的合力。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 67.63599999999997,
      "end": 71.66799999999996,
      "duration": 4.032,
      "key": "77e374a5f02f2ac7cebef76e58e702478792d66c1b953b15870893ba6efa7bf1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "学习的下一站，是决策。阿尔法狗不只看棋盘，还判断下一步值不值得走。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 71.90799999999996,
      "end": 77.90799999999996,
      "duration": 6,
      "key": "742f42f432ca4eb9ea32f460a1da4f471a498db31dffdbe1e47eacead4129822"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "神经网络缩小搜索方向，强化学习帮助改进，再与搜索配合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 78.06799999999996,
      "end": 82.96399999999996,
      "duration": 4.896,
      "key": "125afa3772891941f1d0e6be412a67ab3f322a39b137f370ec4ed639d2559a8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "二零一六年，它以四比一战胜李世石。但棋盘，还不是整个世界。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 83.12399999999995,
      "end": 88.52399999999996,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "key": "323d37f26341079e9c467cf8e7c2378f1f7303ed461a9168780395f02c0891f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "语言更棘手：相隔很远的词，可能决定彼此的意思。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 88.80399999999996,
      "end": 92.69199999999996,
      "duration": 3.888,
      "key": "5417ce19fb72f3941c600d0947a6de84494e43e45269b56e325eef7aa832317d"
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "二零一七年，变换器架构用注意力，让不同位置的信息按相关性组合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 92.85199999999996,
      "end": 98.22799999999997,
      "duration": 5.376,
      "key": "10f912ba0efb8459612c4e0aa3d94121facb1011f7560ce58120d455783f0b1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "这种架构适合并行训练，也成为许多大语言模型的基础。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 98.38799999999996,
      "end": 102.65999999999997,
      "duration": 4.272,
      "key": "03c6b077326f95fb7cfefcc12f14b55a44f2b34848f537d3bb4d528cd938fa98"
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "text": "常见的预训练任务很朴素：根据前文，预测下一个词元。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 102.81999999999996,
      "end": 107.09199999999997,
      "duration": 4.272,
      "key": "9cbcb6d3738dcd1442ee01c3e8e410d24a2d157fb83a42fae1ed79a3629e03bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "text": "在海量文本中反复预测，网络学到了语言模式和知识关联。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 107.25199999999997,
      "end": 112.12399999999997,
      "duration": 4.872,
      "key": "4c5b1660fe8ba048ab46cafa5f806275bc5798bbfab7654e1d3dccc4cdabe052"
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "text": "再经过指令示范和反馈训练，它才更适合与人对话。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 112.28399999999996,
      "end": 116.48399999999997,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "key": "046f7315de8ff71a96c0ffa4aafd00c33f1f043a1a8a4238e2dd09273edcaa20"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "text": "二零二二年，聊天机器人把这场积累，带到普通人面前。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 116.64399999999996,
      "end": 120.86799999999997,
      "duration": 4.224,
      "key": "f2015e25b1fa64b1da8e980aeb1e217dab4d437e9ad6edae6b49d290b48eff73"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "text": "再往后，文字、图像、声音，也开始在同一系统中汇合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 121.02799999999996,
      "end": 125.56399999999996,
      "duration": 4.536,
      "key": "495ae9945f1a2ed21a5a8f6d08baaae5c4dbfa0da4fbb3b0d9be11b202fea74e"
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "text": "所以，这不是某天突然觉醒。是几十年的方法、数据和计算，终于彼此接通。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 125.72399999999996,
      "end": 131.98799999999997,
      "duration": 6.264,
      "key": "e2ba411d5ed0d4714d55f06718dd9e8be77482748feba893c1f42f8498e75ddb"
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "text": "但预测得像真的，不代表事实是真的。模型仍会出错，甚至编造依据。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 132.28799999999998,
      "end": 138.11999999999998,
      "duration": 5.832,
      "key": "b8a85dcfd985ec2d241380a900d6199dc47cd61a8a2be5e074825a4f15c0cd66"
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "text": "可靠的应用，需要核验来源、限制权限，也需要人承担决定的责任。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 138.27999999999997,
      "end": 143.51199999999997,
      "duration": 5.232,
      "key": "04e85e3f39b6e65a6cf0968a76775671a8a473b8a5060883da136626b657bd78"
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "text": "从写下规则，到学习规律，人工智能改变了我们解决问题的方式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 143.67199999999997,
      "end": 148.80799999999996,
      "duration": 5.136,
      "key": "a850c6ce14d75538bfd3a8e66b2dbf6e932301ea048c4b6fba5a25572d492dfd"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31",
      "text": "下一次突破，不只需要更强的机器。还需要，值得解决的问题。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "start": 148.96799999999996,
      "end": 153.91199999999995,
      "duration": 4.944,
      "key": "348705269dbfda481c735cfb9c7ee6c22abfb93fa7246097a3aef3a4efb76637"
    }
  ]
}